              "dark"
            ],
            "reviewNotes": [
              "The prototype opens from a trigger or Command/Control+K. Escape steps back through arguments before closing. Closing returns focus to the invoking control.",
              "Candidate matches stay in the list until confirmed. Confirmed arguments remain editable during review. Validate the selection before execution and retain input on failure.",
              "The reference host can append to the current draft, open a recent conversation and change appearance. Draft insertion leaves sending to the user. Hosts own history access, routing and permissions.",
              "The selected Cloud direction and the earlier prototype share interaction ideas. The leading command icon, confirmed-item treatment and keyboard hints need visual review against the selected direction."
            ]
          }
